 "summary": "Small-signal Schottky barrier diodes in a three-lead SOT-23 package, rated 30 V reverse and 200 mA average forward current. The family has four configurations: one diode (BAT54), two with a shared anode (BAT54A), two with a shared cathode (BAT54C) and two in series (BAT54S). Uses named for them are fast switching, circuit protection and voltage clamping.",
